fetcho
------------------------------------------
Simple fetch made in C++

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libproc2_1-4.0.7-3
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libproc2-devel-4.0.7-3
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/CallMeEchoCodes/fetcho

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/CallMeEchoCodes/fetcho/archive/refs/tags/v1.1.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack fetcho-1.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./fetcho-1.1.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/fetcho-1.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/fetcho-1.1.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(fetcho)
  /usr/bin/fetcho.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/fetcho.README
  /usr/share/doc/fetcho/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/fetcho/README.md

------------------

